    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/1e2df8e5a2dc2e2eee9ac192758799a2.poster.avif?t=1754728802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/1e2df8e5a2dc2e2eee9ac192758799a2.webm?t=1754728802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/1e2df8e5a2dc2e2eee9ac192758799a2.mp4?t=1754728802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Armor. Chaos. Total Destruction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into high\u2011octane tank combat where every wall is just a temporary inconvenience. Everything you see on the map can be reduced to rubble. No artificial barriers\u2014only you, your rivals, and a battlefield that disappears under treads and heavy fire.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/308cbfaecd2d75fdaf014347815ef52c.poster.avif?t=1754728802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/308cbfaecd2d75fdaf014347815ef52c.webm?t=1754728802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/308cbfaecd2d75fdaf014347815ef52c.mp4?t=1754728802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Why You\u2019ll Love It</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online PvP With Friends:</strong> Squad up or face off in intense, fast\u2011paced tank battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power\u2011Ups &amp; Progression:</strong> Grab airborne drops or earn rewards mid\u2011match to boost armor, firepower, reload speed, mobility, and restore HP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Up &amp; Unlock:</strong> Score big, unlock new stages, upgrade your tank, and carve your legend into the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully Destructible Environments:</strong> Blast through buildings, defenses, and anything in your way\u2014create your own attack paths.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\uded1 Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a mine\u2011strewn battlefield packed with unique challenges and special rewards. Complete objectives, dodge traps, earn points\u2014every move is a risk that could pay off huge\u2026 or end in a spectacular explosion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd1d Co\u2011Op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up against AI forces. Capture and hold territory, build walls and traps, coordinate maneuvers. In this mode, teamwork is everything\u2014and the map rewards squads that think ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 Classic Multiplayer: Free\u2011For\u2011All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No rules. No mercy. Rack up points by destroying anyone who crosses your sightline. Play online with friends\u2014today\u2019s ally can be tomorrow\u2019s target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Living, Hazard\u2011Filled Battlefield</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Missile turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explosive walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden surprises you\u2019ll only discover in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every map tests your reflexes, strategy, and nerve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Airdrops Change Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the skies: when a cargo plane appears, it\u2019s carrying rare loot. Reach the drop before your enemies to secure strategic upgrades\u2014reinforcements, repairs, limited\u2011time boosts, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fire up the engine, rally your crew, level the map, and prove whose tank rules the warzone. Your tactics. Your tracks. Your victory.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/1e2df8e5a2dc2e2eee9ac192758799a2.poster.avif?t=1754728802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/1e2df8e5a2dc2e2eee9ac192758799a2.webm?t=1754728802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/1e2df8e5a2dc2e2eee9ac192758799a2.mp4?t=1754728802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Armor. Chaos. Total Destruction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into high\u2011octane tank combat where every wall is just a temporary inconvenience. Everything you see on the map can be reduced to rubble. No artificial barriers\u2014only you, your rivals, and a battlefield that disappears under treads and heavy fire.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/308cbfaecd2d75fdaf014347815ef52c.poster.avif?t=1754728802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/308cbfaecd2d75fdaf014347815ef52c.webm?t=1754728802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704170/extras/308cbfaecd2d75fdaf014347815ef52c.mp4?t=1754728802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Why You\u2019ll Love It</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online PvP With Friends:</strong> Squad up or face off in intense, fast\u2011paced tank battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power\u2011Ups &amp; Progression:</strong> Grab airborne drops or earn rewards mid\u2011match to boost armor, firepower, reload speed, mobility, and restore HP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Up &amp; Unlock:</strong> Score big, unlock new stages, upgrade your tank, and carve your legend into the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully Destructible Environments:</strong> Blast through buildings, defenses, and anything in your way\u2014create your own attack paths.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\uded1 Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a mine\u2011strewn battlefield packed with unique challenges and special rewards. Complete objectives, dodge traps, earn points\u2014every move is a risk that could pay off huge\u2026 or end in a spectacular explosion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd1d Co\u2011Op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up against AI forces. Capture and hold territory, build walls and traps, coordinate maneuvers. In this mode, teamwork is everything\u2014and the map rewards squads that think ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 Classic Multiplayer: Free\u2011For\u2011All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No rules. No mercy. Rack up points by destroying anyone who crosses your sightline. Play online with friends\u2014today\u2019s ally can be tomorrow\u2019s target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Living, Hazard\u2011Filled Battlefield</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Missile turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explosive walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden surprises you\u2019ll only discover in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every map tests your reflexes, strategy, and nerve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Airdrops Change Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the skies: when a cargo plane appears, it\u2019s carrying rare loot. Reach the drop before your enemies to secure strategic upgrades\u2014reinforcements, repairs, limited\u2011time boosts, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fire up the engine, rally your crew, level the map, and prove whose tank rules the warzone. Your tactics. Your tracks. Your victory.</p>",
